cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark package, please cite the associated manuscript and archived release."
title: "Raspberry Pi 5 Hash-Based Signature Benchmark"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Rana"
    given-names: "Sohaib"
    affiliation: "Universiti Sains Malaysia"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sohaibrana1/rpi5-hbs-benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for an empirical Raspberry Pi 5 study of
  stateful XMSS/XMSS-MT and standardized stateless SLH-DSA. The package
  includes frozen source provenance, benchmark metadata, publication-level
  analysis artifacts, validation manifests, and figures.
keywords:
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - hash-based signatures
  - XMSS
  - XMSS-MT
  - SLH-DSA
  - FIPS 205
  - Raspberry Pi 5
  - benchmarking
